{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1237,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:793676bfa6ffd9d1646865af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天的微风也会变成热风！\r\n这就是神鹰武斗术！\r\n怎么样，要来试一试吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c45e705951d7274cc1ee95c2fc6189cf078a3ab7ea92ce4ff2c05b967a1c0673",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ca38217a0149ce6339e8d61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天的怪谈也交给神鹰吧！\r\n害怕的时候就声势浩大地\r\n跳神鹰拳舞Death！波涛啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba8fd9259f3311d8963a0703f38b7332f0d6f2bad9dfd627aa417e19b85b98a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4893d82a2ac32c7044f7cd17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比枯叶落在地上还要快速\r\n的打击！这就是神鹰式落叶拳！\r\n清扫落叶的时候试试吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99b1477e2dc49b6466867c805708245fc306889eaf572fe5cca42f36dc131b10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4830aa00dd903c3cdbdcda15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天的寒流在神鹰武斗术面前\r\n根本算不上什么！上衣什么的\r\n不穿也是小意……阿嚏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aea4e9e14a21174e6bd6e9ddf8b0d178a1ee95cba31aa0dc1cfa14fa8fb43b8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:616003fc5a08a705c212d107",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寄宿于其中的火焰是赤诚燃烧的斗争心！\r\n这件衣服，正是不输给任何人的，\r\n神鹰的意志本身Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8ca326577af07de3ba8473f1f5aa557ea0d81a5cebbc1fd3184d1b4b0eb16e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a50dc014c14662bbe6abce0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～último地帅气！\r\n仅仅只是穿着它，神鹰的灵魂就会\r\n熊熊燃烧并炙热起来Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb8240bb627ce73f4a61b8ef22fd049f7e4288bd661fd3bcaf550f199d13a4c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f4660c02af6d0eca7ab71cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧来吧！训练的时间Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45a7cf52788adb977cf81bc44c1deea8b4308d03a8412460e881586fd710c909",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49a9355ae97647a40bcc6d49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行っきますよぉ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ac4d2a6c6b3eeed320955698e6f922d3ada310dd0aff0ff7e32563755bad382",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:912679827d1c321276332de2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神鹰……非常完美！\r\n可以随时开始训练哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80f4e3227062186c3612559a9e1d8206d0ec08ba63bf05d39cdddfb922b645d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d091ab7fa17f2a2097bdb901",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！请给我训练的指示吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9be6aabc51d498053db1b0db4af6d1adad369a8fe4f33dbdafade2914cb92a4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bd1b17f2e0f6c9f5af1003f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经准备好可以飞翔了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdddcc2fe7ffc3ccf6df459a6c13a99558cf3b5c4e81798d09076286cf96c504",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaca90f80b77f6b5a0f2bd21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了成为世界最强，\r\n开始进行último・训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c50a556f14521a884ccbbd8b92b5569bc8c77e4ed6a895e7b555bdb28db1bef5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e9b4fb4444547fd595593b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神鹰不打算输给任何人！\r\n为了可以赢所有人，\r\n就要更努力训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16e35f7ce80a5eba5e4578cf62b95451c12da1ae7cb459d31172b061f0c00bb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:589cdd54dd32be8c3f2c8065",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最强！无敌！其名为神鹰！\r\n今天也一样要一如往常地飞翔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd2c238db848ea995a05aa6b4c81f6ea90504cf894c685e5e40231bc8a2dd1a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:372384e1a089384228572755",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "严格！激烈！不宽待！\r\n就麻烦你给我这种感觉的\r\n训练Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e364c4b31f3cccf09d09deb4949a9e3679c0f95b15cf69f6153d193aaf3ffc60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea6a6eb02a48bde3242ee360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，开始修行Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbebdc63fdeb4e2669042a864336188aca533b701ff9cd2412b663fac1e07252",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5736dab72ecee88f633d11d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神鹰随时都是备战状态！\r\n无论什么都尽管过来Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7388afcbfa00d108c5a316e88640236f58c6805000b35dd1d39c9db26eafa7c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e19923ba00b0a6b6f44aaba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑步和武术都唯有锻炼Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "504acf97e6ce658cfc84dd4ff933da512d0af30ea48ed9bcd433af378ea18b4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35d5cdbd4fb7c9158152d541",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力！全开！全速前进！\r\n燃烧着灵魂向前冲Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4a4cc464fde224bbc5c16589f572eb79a9bf129078512a24f28504dd0636332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:724cfe3709973ae6cf2b403f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神鹰没有考虑过！\r\n仅仅只是凭着感觉\r\n锻炼而已……Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae9f6f60824d85727e93fd5b8e834e867e4e083f9b037d51a4b004fbfdcc5673",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65b91cb3a43d5d47126b3ee5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为最快的方法……那就是每日的锻炼\r\n做还是不做……\r\n就这么简单Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d954681f4ffc11b7085125d4528d92fd5fa2c9adca9e281b194aff8c6851e5f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f043551fafba25db3d325ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是草地还是世界\r\n，最快最强的神鹰都会\r\n漂亮地拯救给你看Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6e396e2fc2a4e620321feac53195a2a3263edad4d518872b4dee2572722aac1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9d8e3a1c3dab55813e85520",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神鹰跟你变成最强搭档了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "000b39639c52be2758fd3bcf44ca361e8bc0bac89119667c22b9fa5abbdf0302",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e91061c5737819f055602ca5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "离世界最强越来越近了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d9362cb24c436d08fabd7165471fe947dda144dbd0c94be512f73ff62008508",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11330bc29c83ae8464361094",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我不是孤身一人，所以才能够飞到这里！\r\n和大家在一起的话，\r\n无论怎样的世界都能努力下去Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5fc68556eab8ed838e17379f606056f1763f953ff3009710b04f11c3b2269f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98ed20cff9b26e3a3e377933",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神鹰武斗术的强大，证明完毕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9c6bef63d6ec5867d25f5a1bc2c4680602b80d9794250a62fc4c9f0ca5e28fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12d364eeb8bc3872fe1ae04d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦哦……！感觉身体好热Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe1c95e80a36c4f0dee64a9845bcb7aaf4f39ba02ea46fc1cd04f0e1aca8ee23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:817023e140d0668bcf0c914f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神鹰，越来越接近世界最强了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d2e68523214d3761bd9605acffe03740ccf066a6815da377e6bec89b08d9a38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fd0fe681d3f90b161abdf04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是神鹰，请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a83ddc9524a97f4b1d4c7c14df49273bb0b9ac7b91b63de7cd01347a52859a5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b5a7c3455b026032dd93f96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "由神鹰来负责支援吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f18bebabc8540d1c24e9e64efb84339ab344c8eff329adaac303e7052d41a9fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6cc9982aa22701d994e6614",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神鹰的支援也是世界最强Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f300fd66df17a3808290b49272c30c7e010fd8df3e6c97917b60ad4a83f58144",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6fe07f09b1abf511966008e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Level up！\r\n以这个状态，继续不断地积累经验值Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cce374da5c91cfd98b2bb58fa2954986817cd347aadea0ff18054d090e18e4ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:336692194a19d1e5f8b04997",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Uno！dos！tres！\r\n神鹰武斗术，没有极限Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4688ef7decda185448e06758ff7d5c0d5566831bd1ddce846c911c0d8c089205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:499e51b0ffd55e83a86bd9f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冲击！拳击！猛击波ー！！！！！\r\n神鹰武斗术无敌Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab3ad6f980e641e3d0f34ebb33a6b777dc3836d7f9c56d68467ea326c58497d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d165b047606a4fd01097e8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神鹰！\r\n拯救世界Dea——th！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a6bf29c32b317cf9f0229e6005174524815b8f796d3a5cc5116916b9806aae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d9ea1cc44761705ac66458a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽地出征吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dae79e96aca6616af46e02ede7bc36465695181a7c4b30ad0d6fe1fa1cbee468",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59e02b6c33df459878bfb396",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈哈！\r\n居然能成为我「霸王」的训练员，\r\n你真────的很走运！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e993498ec9b6c2c6e18d0ea9a402547573931842bfd1a2ee230a8071d190d70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6323f60839917c823f3c700a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるとしよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9280c39b009c33bade69f70271ba3cf4e2cf35a07e4caf530e1ca04e96391f72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebf09644e24688efe1bebfd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ボクの帰還だよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "107da3896c490a6c075293b0d7b64d8aab51708ae926d7ea200b580b1e270730",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:551b7b152d80ac8d5b14009e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的话语率直无比，\r\n所以才能够信任。\r\n呵呵，往后就靠你咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36b19ec37fede78283dc078ce5f7f700be9ca7d79d3edd167fe356b4b410976a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05298eda16bd9076ae0f3727",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还没跟自己分出胜负……\r\n哎呀，该怎么做才能赢啊！？\r\n拜托你告诉我……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17ff84a741b116074270fa898e39b287b0e62a14000be44f2420caafdbcb1806",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2def4d819e41d40e89ec09d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n你看到了我这个幸福象征，\r\n今年的福气就跟手到擒来没两样了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d1ae578e4bccd9538a15d0a6e8a31dc3f1f303c7869a8fa9e8883f25302e3d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f828b35e9d7b2b0626736954",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都坐立不安呢。\r\n想送我巧克力的话，\r\n根本用不着客气呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfc028fb1dbb28aa94071629c8f3e82b42f4d2311432af6711a5cf2549ae1d23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d634cd9dfc32d8d65614016",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把自己的等身大巧克力\r\n送到你房间了。呵呵，吃掉之前\r\n务必要仔细鉴赏一番哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa9bd38c1fce8349157d514377e6aedbffe0a3afacfba9049bf2e02cb68a4796",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53a17a3de23ee87a2eb0e9e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "银河吗……这个对手\r\n很适合来跟我较量\r\n谁比较耀眼夺目……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7a0aacf63cb49f6d08feacef668f75a94b63027fa938e26f37be97cf7f03b88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2ddf21957f7b32f6168c69b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我没有准备糖果，\r\n因为我打算挺身面对所有恶作剧。\r\n好啦，尽管放马过来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa53455208f46a3fbd5b903f0dfe0832b14a8d8e58175e7eca51299a115de9f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c9eaccad6f15f0a022a65ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有必要特地摆设圣诞树啦。\r\n因为有比圣诞树更耀眼的我\r\n在这里呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d8fa1d03193dbbf781c45e7f9ab9344b7505486f0c6422ca0a37398f4ad96a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:835e1fbcc80811527246e941",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我为你编了一首圣诞歌曲，\r\n听听看吧……「圣诞夜霸王～\r\n身边陪着训练员～」",
      "source_fingerprint": "08a3910142df543338bd31f4b938cd8db92da8890eeab266187d026ab59dba48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24db92fe9846576396ee86bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是理所当然的结果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "296d44b0c9c707970131b79cb95841013d8f4b8ff641618255f860155cf1fb9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc151a8ee4cd329ac0700609",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你最好趁现在看我最后一眼。\r\n因为过年之后\r\n我就要脱胎换骨了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3cb1d8a8f0bdb0574cbc371e353056fd3f67dc3cc78a89c7efade63587b6f25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4abecff031ff92f29a91b976",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都是因为你出生在这个世上，\r\n才能跟我上演这场命中注定的邂逅。\r\n好好为了这份幸福而开心吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ec99d3c16547467ea19ea26ebd7be05a32ccf4141d50868bdc4d15d7dc967aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e38a1f7ea34fbcfd2a36df9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，谢谢你诞生在世界上。\r\n你的存在又为我增添了几分\r\n崭新的光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bb76dae056ee2cab4a25610f84796bbcc343f7dade54bf2b11517db5f0e10e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27a8b8546460012a0360a465",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈哈！就把我出生的\r\n那个辉煌日子，\r\n制定为「霸王纪念日」吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8b4441a7de5a0694f4e0ac3a0949fb895daddfa9c0390d05c42915923bd3569",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:170fc7380b26917b0d8f3101",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然能在身边庆祝我的诞生，\r\n你真的很幸福呢！\r\n哎哎，我好羡慕你哦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7916619624108bd2fe4ada6a0d6a10f25f619a8be62e58f0212b339b6c09a5a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84c564f2e2b969d06e5813f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还以为是写给我的情书，\r\n结果好像是给你的公告。\r\n你确认看看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c1ddc1a7db52fbe28a5e99f5d672aae31c3722e9a3ee4069a933a523e74ace2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a1348f480d6cd3afd8dd3cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎有礼物要送给你。\r\n呵呵，你也挺有两下子的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b27ead27be419d549ef5c5671115a53c9ab145df3f25680c1f2c2e12205b187f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df0d57fbbfc532088b74e10c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来任务达成了。\r\n真不愧是我的训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "045fa14a9fdc12b3048e031ec59b51b343df9993e941d076456b823f954432fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f534663f5454e412c634427e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像就快要举办活动了。\r\n呵呵，主角是不是我呢？？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aa4b7b567b547247e5e37a88d047a3fe87e33da4cd7721b1fbe245e01c1615f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edd175674fcb95d46a631148",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动好像开始了！\r\n哈哈哈哈！\r\n我们去让大家知道谁才是主角！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b81d6ed1636cff24615b3fe928f97499793b588697ab21e72c57bd016aa3c517",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef52472cf2799383c2a1755a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太遗憾了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d8a565badea463d7e46dd935fa389e0610161e938859c3aee45106a758a5e58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb76ba573b21b74828db230e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb38210f42caaf4764055c5126d4768337c3d2f4190b1a16a114571230f9484d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00054ddc46f2c5a4f03e4a8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はーっはっは！この服はボクに\r\n着られて世界一幸せものだね！\r\n世界幸服度ランキング1位さ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a13a0dd90ee6df197fc0befb219548f69eb073e9ea88d9c91907c631db13bb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fe8a1abf067e0820ee09b30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "サングラスの着用を\r\n推奨するよ！ボクの放つ光が\r\n強すぎるばかりに！すまない！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b3d265172f1cc4823b887de48eb04f9fa0bd8e0be306baa91690034ce530402",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b21463ef60b751782a4720eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつファッションショーに\r\n呼ばれてもいいよう備えているよ。\r\nランウェイの主役も無論ボクさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cf0717279a43310852329805ee03f98c33f4138a588364e63f33296786b438f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a669165100c2bb170f34de6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我会赢的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38773a6762b9a03d8201b84ac4137d48f834b851de233752f4b160f672d9f4c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afec2a5492d19c3daf3faa79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干得好，是我们获胜了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "887af84a0577d9c8f7dc090a9ef978a0907a6e463e261429600f27c9c26806e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c1130fbbe13ed453540f465",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太遗憾了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d8a565badea463d7e46dd935fa389e0610161e938859c3aee45106a758a5e58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91016fb98a01b44b709bb30d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我会赢的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38773a6762b9a03d8201b84ac4137d48f834b851de233752f4b160f672d9f4c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:628cdd99a9168f323208e396",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更新最高分……！太出色了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76481c5c08e6452e82320bac35c06699d6f619f68d981553690e648fcb514a9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0348be14ccd93bdab79e45a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟我来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c4cf22924f9ad91dbed0dd624d9d154868110d944c770e2136af840b478b5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a9608ce1d571220170e404f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始这段故事吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1f4650e423d88baf8f87442c5a69951d9d96c21d3ddbbf7c563c9439b84be8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "1023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac9558ef45d900311e2f9d72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为闪亮的星星吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5225d2d23a248d8568b75e30d922b0b3d1c939367eb5cac8d8a0a65c9ea04ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "1037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a419c59b168bf632997583b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起取得胜利吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a90e0620b7519475adc44c109f60caf7360f17892883a96f7d25bc6c26e0f07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "1038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0a36cee68a9eee24910e943",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为闪亮的星星吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5225d2d23a248d8568b75e30d922b0b3d1c939367eb5cac8d8a0a65c9ea04ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "1046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e51527e1c7b9b8484457bd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9739210a9a0ea66377618de7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们往更高的目标迈进吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7c8065e485bb62c116dbc5890485fdd02100e3c55578bd41b78cef6a3a0c8b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f23f3c5e23a45e7f257980",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一同写下故事吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "628a8bf74658bd318a8207c1d7daded4f7d02f3008620730c9a4d90405c6bff9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:230881932fcc9fbcbfdf3194",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要报名参加比赛啊。\r\n轮到我出场了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c48cd8a5c9ec68b6c9a49ec28767f6b526a5cc53d1bdc77b398c5fe1be7c2b5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63ada9c06c5f09a179bf1e51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "由我们亲手掌握！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34eb41c2515cbde2e17f17de2cf995943fd2dec511bd626c81d42e04d6ef53af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "1109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:847cedb48b79876dc97a95a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
